<Slide style={{ padding: '0px' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 10, background: '#0E3F8C' }} />
  <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>第二个关键发现：线性回归赢过随机森林、XGBoost、LightGBM、LSTM</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ padding: '20px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 268, gap: 22, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}> Persistence（硬编码上一刻）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>2.5648</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}> 线性回归（学到系数 0.9788）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>2.7136　−5.80%</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}> 随机森林（200 棵，分段常数）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>3.1521　−22.90%</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>只给「上一刻功率」一个特征时</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>最优解就是 P(t)=P(t−1)。线性回归把系数学到 0.9788，几乎就是这条直线。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>树模型只能输出叶子里训练样本的平均值，无法表达这条恒等式。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, height: 244, marginTop: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 20px', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>它解释了一个反常现象</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>在辐射平稳的时段，随机森林比 Persistence 差 163% —— 因为它非要给每个叶子凑一个平均值，凭空制造抖动。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>所以「模型一定比基线好」这个前提，本身就不成立</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 20px', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>同时刻气象，历史替代不了</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>在最优的「气象 + 历史」设定里，只要删掉 6 个同时刻气象变量，MAE 立刻恶化 61.49%。</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 14px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>历史里再怎么滚，也滚不出此刻的云</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, bottom: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>09 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
